Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: regedit: Scale the address bar, splitter and value icons to the DPI.
 The address bar height, the splitter width and initial position and the
 value type icons of the list had fixed pixel sizes. Scale them to the
 screen DPI and create the list's image list at the small icon size.
Last-Modified: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:50:00 +0300

